<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "run one analysis lens over a sensorium or a rows matrix"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///sense.rhythm.analyzes"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.rhythm.analyzes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/sense.rhythm.analyzes"
